agent-cli – command-line access to your agent: connect this machine and send notifications to your chats. More at https://agent.appifyhub.com
Usage: agent-cli <command> [flags]

Commands:
  connect     Connect this machine to your profile using a connect key
  revoke-all  Revoke access for all CLIs on all your machines
  status      Show local readiness and backend status
  chats       List chats and manage the default target
  notify      Send a notification to one of your chats
  unlock      Unlock a passphrase-protected token for this terminal
  env         Show the environment variables the CLI reads
  skill       Teach AI coding agents to use this CLI
  completion  Generate shell completion scripts
  help        Help for any command

Flags: -v/--verbose, -h/--help, --version
Environment: THE_AGENT_CLI_TOKEN, THE_AGENT_CLI_DEFAULT_CHAT, THE_AGENT_CLI_DEFAULT_PLATFORM, THE_AGENT_CLI_PASSPHRASE, THE_AGENT_CLI_API_URL, THE_AGENT_CLI_HOME, NO_COLOR
Exit codes: 0 ok · 1 failure · 2 usage error · 3 not connected or locked · 4 chat unreachable · 5 insufficient credits · 6 rate limited
